sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Owner
    participant H as Harness
    participant DB as Oracle
    participant J as Scheduler job
    participant W as Notification worker
    O->>H: start a Pomodoro on task T
    H->>DB: INSERT focus session (RUNNING)
    H->>DB: CREATE one-shot job at the end time
    Note over J: 25 minutes pass. Nothing else is running.
    J->>DB: mark COMPLETED, INSERT notification
    W->>DB: read pending notifications
    W->>O: Session finished. You captured 2 distractions.
